00:23:06,480 --> 00:23:14,079
him? Who struck? Do whale? One big, one little. What a ye man? Cried Starbucks.

281
00:23:14,080 --> 00:23:18,638
Lookie here, said Quiquake, pointing down.

282
00:23:18,639 --> 00:23:23,274
as when the stricken whale that from the tub is reeled out hundreds of fathoms of

