348
00:28:46,480 --> 00:28:51,838
Grip your oars and clutch your souls now. My god, men, stand by. Shove him

349
00:28:51,839 --> 00:28:58,318
off, you quiquake the whale there. Prick him. Hit him. Stand up. Stand up and

350
00:28:58,319 --> 00:29:06,159
